('rp-pte-expansion-fill-in-blanks-rw-3', 'pte-2026-01', 'Museum object labels', '[{"label": "A", "text": "A regional museum replaced several technical labels with questions inviting visitors to examine the objects closely. One label beside a ceramic bowl asked what marks on its base might reveal about production. Visitors spent longer at the display, but the museum did not immediately conclude that they had learned more. Longer visits could indicate curiosity, confusion or simply congestion in a narrow gallery. Staff therefore observed conversations and invited visitors to explain one feature they had noticed. These additional measures suggested that the questions encouraged discussion between adults and children. Some specialists nevertheless preferred the detailed terminology on the original labels. The museum responded by keeping the introductory questions and adding optional information cards nearby. This layered approach offered different levels of detail without requiring everyone to read the same long text."}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 0, 'medium', 'Community and research', ARRAY['PTE','Original practice'], TRUE, 'custom'),
('rp-pte-expansion-fill-in-blanks-r-3', 'pte-2026-01', 'Museum object labels', '[{"label": "A", "text": "A regional museum replaced several technical labels with questions inviting visitors to examine the objects closely. One label beside a ceramic bowl asked what marks on its base might reveal about production. Visitors spent longer at the display, but the museum did not immediately conclude that they had learned more. Longer visits could indicate curiosity, confusion or simply congestion in a narrow gallery. Staff therefore observed conversations and invited visitors to explain one feature they had noticed. These additional measures suggested that the questions encouraged discussion between adults and children. Some specialists nevertheless preferred the detailed terminology on the original labels. The museum responded by keeping the introductory questions and adding optional information cards nearby. This layered approach offered different levels of detail without requiring everyone to read the same long text."}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 0, 'medium', 'Community and research', ARRAY['PTE','Original practice'], TRUE, 'custom'),
