('pte-expansion-003', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'reading', 'reading-mcq-single', 'Multiple Choice, Single Answer', 'Repair cafes', 'Which statement best expresses the main point of the passage?', 180, 0, 1, 1, 'medium', ARRAY['PTE','Original practice','Expansion 2026'], 'Their educational value extends beyond whether each item is repaired. Owners are expected to participate in the repair process. Repair records may help identify components for further investigation.', 'rp-pte-expansion-reading-mcq-single-1', 'g-pte-expansion-reading-mcq-single-1', NULL, NULL, '[{"id": "A", "text": "Their educational value extends beyond whether each item is repaired."}, {"id": "B", "text": "They provide representative statistics on all household products."}, {"id": "C", "text": "Their main purpose is to replace professional repair businesses."}, {"id": "D", "text": "They require manufacturers to redesign every faulty component."}]'::jsonb, '["A"]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('pte-expansion-004', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'reading', 'reading-mcq-multiple', 'Multiple Choice, Multiple Answers', 'Repair cafes', 'Which statements are supported by the passage? Select all correct answers.', 180, 0, 1, 2, 'medium', ARRAY['PTE','Original practice','Expansion 2026'], 'Their educational value extends beyond whether each item is repaired. Owners are expected to participate in the repair process. Repair records may help identify components for further investigation.', 'rp-pte-expansion-reading-mcq-multiple-1', 'g-pte-expansion-reading-mcq-multiple-1', NULL, NULL, '[{"id": "A", "text": "Owners are expected to participate in the repair process."}, {"id": "B", "text": "Every object brought to a cafe is successfully repaired."}, {"id": "C", "text": "Repair records may help identify components for further investigation."}, {"id": "D", "text": "Cafe visitors form a random sample of product owners."}]'::jsonb, '["A", "C"]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('pte-expansion-005', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'reading', 'fill-in-blanks-rw', 'Reading & Writing: Fill in the Blanks', 'Night-time bus trials', 'Select the best word for each blank.', 180, 0, 1, 3, 'medium', ARRAY['PTE','Original practice','Expansion 2026'], 'In context, the missing words are modest, reliable, alternatives.', 'rp-pte-expansion-fill-in-blanks-rw-2', 'g-pte-expansion-fill-in-blanks-rw-2', 'A city transport team tested a later bus service on two routes for six weeks. Passenger numbers were [[b1]], so an initial report recommended cancellation. Interviews subsequently showed that several shift workers had accepted evening work because the buses gave them a [[b2]] way home. Counting journeys alone had overlooked this benefit. The team also discovered that publicity had reached regular passengers but few potential new users. A longer trial with wider advertising might therefore produce different results. Nevertheless, the interviews did not prove that demand would eventually cover operating costs. The researchers recommended comparing the service with [[b3]], including a shared taxi scheme. They proposed recording who benefited, how reliably vehicles arrived and the cost per completed journey. The council postponed its final decision until this broader evidence was available.', '[{"id": "b1", "options": ["identical", "mandatory", "permanent", "modest"], "correctAnswer": "modest"}, {"id": "b2", "options": ["costly", "private", "reliable", "remote"], "correctAnswer": "reliable"}, {"id": "b3", "options": ["delays", "alternatives", "certainties", "passengers"], "correctAnswer": "alternatives"}]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
