('pte-expansion-007', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'reading', 'reading-mcq-single', 'Multiple Choice, Single Answer', 'Night-time bus trials', 'Which statement best expresses the main point of the passage?', 180, 0, 1, 1, 'medium', ARRAY['PTE','Original practice','Expansion 2026'], 'A service should be evaluated against several clearly stated objectives. Some workers used the service to travel home after evening shifts. Advertising had missed some potential passengers.', 'rp-pte-expansion-reading-mcq-single-2', 'g-pte-expansion-reading-mcq-single-2', NULL, NULL, '[{"id": "A", "text": "Interviews established that ticket sales would cover all costs."}, {"id": "B", "text": "The council permanently cancelled both routes after six weeks."}, {"id": "C", "text": "Passenger volume is irrelevant to transport planning."}, {"id": "D", "text": "A service should be evaluated against several clearly stated objectives."}]'::jsonb, '["D"]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('pte-expansion-008', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'reading', 'reading-mcq-multiple', 'Multiple Choice, Multiple Answers', 'Night-time bus trials', 'Which statements are supported by the passage? Select all correct answers.', 180, 0, 1, 2, 'medium', ARRAY['PTE','Original practice','Expansion 2026'], 'A service should be evaluated against several clearly stated objectives. Some workers used the service to travel home after evening shifts. Advertising had missed some potential passengers.', 'rp-pte-expansion-reading-mcq-multiple-2', 'g-pte-expansion-reading-mcq-multiple-2', NULL, NULL, '[{"id": "A", "text": "The trial ran on every route in the city."}, {"id": "B", "text": "Advertising had missed some potential passengers."}, {"id": "C", "text": "Shared taxis were rejected without comparison."}, {"id": "D", "text": "Some workers used the service to travel home after evening shifts."}]'::jsonb, '["B", "D"]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('pte-expansion-009', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'reading', 'fill-in-blanks-rw', 'Reading & Writing: Fill in the Blanks', 'Museum object labels', 'Select the best word for each blank.', 180, 0, 1, 3, 'medium', ARRAY['PTE','Original practice','Expansion 2026'], 'In context, the missing words are technical, congestion, optional.', 'rp-pte-expansion-fill-in-blanks-rw-3', 'g-pte-expansion-fill-in-blanks-rw-3', 'A regional museum replaced several [[b1]] labels with questions inviting visitors to examine the objects closely. One label beside a ceramic bowl asked what marks on its base might reveal about production. Visitors spent longer at the display, but the museum did not immediately conclude that they had learned more. Longer visits could indicate curiosity, confusion or simply [[b2]] in a narrow gallery. Staff therefore observed conversations and invited visitors to explain one feature they had noticed. These additional measures suggested that the questions encouraged discussion between adults and children. Some specialists nevertheless preferred the detailed terminology on the original labels. The museum responded by keeping the introductory questions and adding [[b3]] information cards nearby. This layered approach offered different levels of detail without requiring everyone to read the same long text.', '[{"id": "b1", "options": ["portable", "seasonal", "technical", "fragile"], "correctAnswer": "technical"}, {"id": "b2", "options": ["agreement", "congestion", "precision", "restoration"], "correctAnswer": "congestion"}, {"id": "b3", "options": ["optional", "compulsory", "identical", "irrelevant"], "correctAnswer": "optional"}]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
