('pte-expansion-011', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'reading', 'reading-mcq-single', 'Multiple Choice, Single Answer', 'Museum object labels', 'Which statement best expresses the main point of the passage?', 180, 0, 1, 1, 'medium', ARRAY['PTE','Original practice','Expansion 2026'], 'Different layers of information can serve visitors with different needs. Staff asked visitors to explain a feature they had noticed. Detailed information remained available on nearby cards.', 'rp-pte-expansion-reading-mcq-single-3', 'g-pte-expansion-reading-mcq-single-3', NULL, NULL, '[{"id": "A", "text": "Technical information should be removed from every museum."}, {"id": "B", "text": "Children cannot discuss objects without specialist terminology."}, {"id": "C", "text": "Different layers of information can serve visitors with different needs."}, {"id": "D", "text": "Longer visits always demonstrate more accurate understanding."}]'::jsonb, '["C"]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('pte-expansion-012', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'reading', 'reading-mcq-multiple', 'Multiple Choice, Multiple Answers', 'Museum object labels', 'Which statements are supported by the passage? Select all correct answers.', 180, 0, 1, 2, 'medium', ARRAY['PTE','Original practice','Expansion 2026'], 'Different layers of information can serve visitors with different needs. Staff asked visitors to explain a feature they had noticed. Detailed information remained available on nearby cards.', 'rp-pte-expansion-reading-mcq-multiple-3', 'g-pte-expansion-reading-mcq-multiple-3', NULL, NULL, '[{"id": "A", "text": "Detailed information remained available on nearby cards."}, {"id": "B", "text": "Every visitor was required to read the information cards."}, {"id": "C", "text": "Staff asked visitors to explain a feature they had noticed."}, {"id": "D", "text": "The experiment proved that congestion never affected visit length."}]'::jsonb, '["A", "C"]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('pte-expansion-013', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'reading', 'fill-in-blanks-rw', 'Reading & Writing: Fill in the Blanks', 'Shared research equipment', 'Select the best word for each blank.', 180, 0, 1, 3, 'medium', ARRAY['PTE','Original practice','Expansion 2026'], 'In context, the missing words are expenditure, calibration, reliable.', 'rp-pte-expansion-fill-in-blanks-rw-4', 'g-pte-expansion-fill-in-blanks-rw-4', 'Several university departments agreed to share an expensive imaging instrument instead of buying separate machines. The arrangement reduced initial [[b1]], but scheduling soon became difficult. Experiments needed different amounts of preparation, and a short booking sometimes delayed the following user. A committee initially proposed charging departments for every minute of access. Technicians warned that this might discourage necessary cleaning and [[b2]] between sessions. The committee instead introduced protected maintenance periods and required users to estimate preparation time separately from measurement time. It also appointed a coordinator to resolve conflicts. Utilisation fell slightly because the timetable now included maintenance, yet fewer experiments had to be repeated. The departments concluded that keeping the machine continuously occupied was a poor substitute for producing [[b3]] results. Sharing equipment required investment in coordination as well as agreement over purchase costs.', '[{"id": "b1", "options": ["distance", "expenditure", "temperature", "enrolment"], "correctAnswer": "expenditure"}, {"id": "b2", "options": ["calibration", "decoration", "advertising", "transport"], "correctAnswer": "calibration"}, {"id": "b3", "options": ["identical", "immediate", "profitable", "reliable"], "correctAnswer": "reliable"}]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('pte-expansion-014', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'reading', 'fill-in-blanks-r', 'Reading: Fill in the Blanks', 'Shared research equipment', 'Select the best word for each blank.', 180, 0, 1, 3, 'medium', ARRAY['PTE','Original practice','Expansion 2026'], 'In context, the missing words are expenditure, calibration, reliable.', 'rp-pte-expansion-fill-in-blanks-r-4', 'g-pte-expansion-fill-in-blanks-r-4', 'Several university departments agreed to share an expensive imaging instrument instead of buying separate machines. The arrangement reduced initial [[b1]], but scheduling soon became difficult. Experiments needed different amounts of preparation, and a short booking sometimes delayed the following user. A committee initially proposed charging departments for every minute of access. Technicians warned that this might discourage necessary cleaning and [[b2]] between sessions. The committee instead introduced protected maintenance periods and required users to estimate preparation time separately from measurement time. It also appointed a coordinator to resolve conflicts. Utilisation fell slightly because the timetable now included maintenance, yet fewer experiments had to be repeated. The departments concluded that keeping the machine continuously occupied was a poor substitute for producing [[b3]] results. Sharing equipment required investment in coordination as well as agreement over purchase costs.', '[{"id": "b1", "options": ["advertising", "calibration", "decoration", "distance", "enrolment", "expenditure", "identical", "immediate", "profitable", "reliable", "temperature", "transport"], "correctAnswer": "expenditure"}, {"id": "b2", "options": ["advertising", "calibration", "decoration", "distance", "enrolment", "expenditure", "identical", "immediate", "profitable", "reliable", "temperature", "transport"], "correctAnswer": "calibration"}, {"id": "b3", "options": ["advertising", "calibration", "decoration", "distance", "enrolment", "expenditure", "identical", "immediate", "profitable", "reliable", "temperature", "transport"], "correctAnswer": "reliable"}]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('pte-expansion-015', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'reading', 'reading-mcq-single', 'Multiple Choice, Single Answer', 'Shared research equipment', 'Which statement best expresses the main point of the passage?', 180, 0, 1, 1, 'medium', ARRAY['PTE','Original practice','Expansion 2026'], 'Coordination and maintenance are essential to successful equipment sharing. Preparation time was recorded separately from measurement time. Fewer experiments required repetition after the scheduling change.', 'rp-pte-expansion-reading-mcq-single-4', 'g-pte-expansion-reading-mcq-single-4', NULL, NULL, '[{"id": "A", "text": "Sharing equipment removed the need for technicians."}, {"id": "B", "text": "Coordination and maintenance are essential to successful equipment sharing."}, {"id": "C", "text": "Charging by the minute eliminated all scheduling conflicts."}, {"id": "D", "text": "Continuous occupation guarantees reliable measurements."}]'::jsonb, '["B"]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('pte-expansion-016', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'reading', 'reading-mcq-multiple', 'Multiple Choice, Multiple Answers', 'Shared research equipment', 'Which statements are supported by the passage? Select all correct answers.', 180, 0, 1, 2, 'medium', ARRAY['PTE','Original practice','Expansion 2026'], 'Coordination and maintenance are essential to successful equipment sharing. Preparation time was recorded separately from measurement time. Fewer experiments required repetition after the scheduling change.', 'rp-pte-expansion-reading-mcq-multiple-4', 'g-pte-expansion-reading-mcq-multiple-4', NULL, NULL, '[{"id": "A", "text": "Technicians recommended eliminating calibration."}, {"id": "B", "text": "Preparation time was recorded separately from measurement time."}, {"id": "C", "text": "Every department purchased an additional machine."}, {"id": "D", "text": "Fewer experiments required repetition after the scheduling change."}]'::jsonb, '["B", "D"]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('pte-expansion-017', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'reading', 'fill-in-blanks-rw', 'Reading & Writing: Fill in the Blanks', 'Community rainfall records', 'Select the best word for each blank.', 180, 0, 1, 3, 'medium', ARRAY['PTE','Original practice','Expansion 2026'], 'In context, the missing words are digitised, defensible, limitations.', 'rp-pte-expansion-fill-in-blanks-rw-5', 'g-pte-expansion-fill-in-blanks-rw-5', 'A local history group [[b1]] handwritten rainfall diaries kept by residents over many decades. The records offered information from places where official weather stations had never operated. However, the volunteers noticed that observers had used different containers and sometimes moved them between gardens. These changes could affect the amounts recorded. Rather than discarding the diaries, the group attached notes describing known changes in method and location. Researchers could then decide which comparisons were [[b2]]. A missing entry was left blank rather than treated as a day without rain. The project also retained images of the original pages so that uncertain handwriting could be checked. Its value lay not in producing a perfectly uniform series, but in making a varied historical record available with its [[b3]] visible. Careful documentation allowed later users to ask questions that the original observers had never anticipated.', '[{"id": "b1", "options": ["digitised", "destroyed", "purchased", "translated"], "correctAnswer": "digitised"}, {"id": "b2", "options": ["profitable", "automatic", "identical", "defensible"], "correctAnswer": "defensible"}, {"id": "b3", "options": ["instructions", "expenses", "limitations", "predictions"], "correctAnswer": "limitations"}]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('pte-expansion-018', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'reading', 'fill-in-blanks-r', 'Reading: Fill in the Blanks', 'Community rainfall records', 'Select the best word for each blank.', 180, 0, 1, 3, 'medium', ARRAY['PTE','Original practice','Expansion 2026'], 'In context, the missing words are digitised, defensible, limitations.', 'rp-pte-expansion-fill-in-blanks-r-5', 'g-pte-expansion-fill-in-blanks-r-5', 'A local history group [[b1]] handwritten rainfall diaries kept by residents over many decades. The records offered information from places where official weather stations had never operated. However, the volunteers noticed that observers had used different containers and sometimes moved them between gardens. These changes could affect the amounts recorded. Rather than discarding the diaries, the group attached notes describing known changes in method and location. Researchers could then decide which comparisons were [[b2]]. A missing entry was left blank rather than treated as a day without rain. The project also retained images of the original pages so that uncertain handwriting could be checked. Its value lay not in producing a perfectly uniform series, but in making a varied historical record available with its [[b3]] visible. Careful documentation allowed later users to ask questions that the original observers had never anticipated.', '[{"id": "b1", "options": ["automatic", "defensible", "destroyed", "digitised", "expenses", "identical", "instructions", "limitations", "predictions", "profitable", "purchased", "translated"], "correctAnswer": "digitised"}, {"id": "b2", "options": ["automatic", "defensible", "destroyed", "digitised", "expenses", "identical", "instructions", "limitations", "predictions", "profitable", "purchased", "translated"], "correctAnswer": "defensible"}, {"id": "b3", "options": ["automatic", "defensible", "destroyed", "digitised", "expenses", "identical", "instructions", "limitations", "predictions", "profitable", "purchased", "translated"], "correctAnswer": "limitations"}]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('pte-expansion-019', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'reading', 'reading-mcq-single', 'Multiple Choice, Single Answer', 'Community rainfall records', 'Which statement best expresses the main point of the passage?', 180, 0, 1, 1, 'medium', ARRAY['PTE','Original practice','Expansion 2026'], 'Historical observations become more useful when their limitations are documented. Some observers moved their measuring containers. Images allowed users to check uncertain handwriting.', 'rp-pte-expansion-reading-mcq-single-5', 'g-pte-expansion-reading-mcq-single-5', NULL, NULL, '[{"id": "A", "text": "Historical observations become more useful when their limitations are documented."}, {"id": "B", "text": "Every missing diary entry was converted to zero rainfall."}, {"id": "C", "text": "All residents had used identical measuring equipment."}, {"id": "D", "text": "Digitisation removed every uncertainty in the original observations."}]'::jsonb, '["A"]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('pte-expansion-020', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'reading', 'reading-mcq-multiple', 'Multiple Choice, Multiple Answers', 'Community rainfall records', 'Which statements are supported by the passage? Select all correct answers.', 180, 0, 1, 2, 'medium', ARRAY['PTE','Original practice','Expansion 2026'], 'Historical observations become more useful when their limitations are documented. Some observers moved their measuring containers. Images allowed users to check uncertain handwriting.', 'rp-pte-expansion-reading-mcq-multiple-5', 'g-pte-expansion-reading-mcq-multiple-5', NULL, NULL, '[{"id": "A", "text": "Some observers moved their measuring containers."}, {"id": "B", "text": "Official weather stations had operated at every diary location."}, {"id": "C", "text": "Images allowed users to check uncertain handwriting."}, {"id": "D", "text": "The group discarded all records with inconsistent methods."}]'::jsonb, '["A", "C"]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('pte-expansion-021', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'reading', 'reorder-paragraphs', 'Re-order Paragraphs', 'Seed library records', 'Restore the logical order of the text boxes.', 180, 0, 0, 3, 'medium', ARRAY['PTE','Original practice','Expansion 2026'], 'Introduce the project, describe its method, report the observation, then show the response to that observation.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{"id": "p4", "text": "These records allowed returning gardeners to identify which plants had produced their new seeds."}, {"id": "p3", "text": "A town library began lending packets of vegetable seeds to local gardeners."}, {"id": "p2", "text": "After the first growing season, staff used that information to prepare clearer instructions for the following year."}, {"id": "p1", "text": "Before distributing the first packets, staff recorded each variety and its source."}]'::jsonb, '["p3", "p1", "p4", "p2"]'::jsonb, 'ri-pte-expansion-1', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('pte-expansion-022', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'reading', 'reorder-paragraphs', 'Re-order Paragraphs', 'Bridge inspection', 'Restore the logical order of the text boxes.', 180, 0, 0, 3, 'medium', ARRAY['PTE','Original practice','Expansion 2026'], 'Introduce the project, describe its method, report the observation, then show the response to that observation.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{"id": "p4", "text": "The first month of readings from the gauge showed movement after heavy rain."}, {"id": "p3", "text": "An engineer inspecting a footbridge noticed a narrow crack near one of its supports."}, {"id": "p2", "text": "On the basis of those readings, the council commissioned a more detailed investigation."}, {"id": "p1", "text": "To determine whether the crack was growing, she fixed a measuring gauge across it."}]'::jsonb, '["p3", "p1", "p4", "p2"]'::jsonb, 'ri-pte-expansion-2', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('pte-expansion-023', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'reading', 'reorder-paragraphs', 'Re-order Paragraphs', 'Archive relocation', 'Restore the logical order of the text boxes.', 180, 0, 0, 3, 'medium', ARRAY['PTE','Original practice','Expansion 2026'], 'Introduce the project, describe its method, report the observation, then show the response to that observation.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{"id": "p4", "text": "Movers scanned each number as the corresponding box left the old building."}, {"id": "p3", "text": "A college decided to move its paper archive to a building with better humidity control."}, {"id": "p2", "text": "At the destination, a second scan confirmed that all the boxes had arrived."}, {"id": "p1", "text": "Before the move, archivists assigned a tracking number to every storage box."}]'::jsonb, '["p3", "p1", "p4", "p2"]'::jsonb, 'ri-pte-expansion-3', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('pte-expansion-024', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'reading', 'reorder-paragraphs', 'Re-order Paragraphs', 'Canteen waste', 'Restore the logical order of the text boxes.', 180, 0, 0, 3, 'medium', ARRAY['PTE','Original practice','Expansion 2026'], 'Introduce the project, describe its method, report the observation, then show the response to that observation.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{"id": "p4", "text": "Those measurements showed that one side dish accounted for most of the waste."}, {"id": "p3", "text": "A school canteen wanted to understand why so much cooked food remained at lunchtime."}, {"id": "p2", "text": "The following week, the kitchen prepared a smaller quantity of that dish and measured the change."}, {"id": "p1", "text": "For the next week, staff weighed the leftovers from each dish separately."}]'::jsonb, '["p3", "p1", "p4", "p2"]'::jsonb, 'ri-pte-expansion-4', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('pte-expansion-025', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'reading', 'reorder-paragraphs', 'Re-order Paragraphs', 'Walking route signs', 'Restore the logical order of the text boxes.', 180, 0, 0, 3, 'medium', ARRAY['PTE','Original practice','Expansion 2026'], 'Introduce the project, describe its method, report the observation, then show the response to that observation.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{"id": "p4", "text": "Several of these visitors hesitated at the same junction despite the new sign."}, {"id": "p3", "text": "A park installed new signs along a walking route that visitors often found confusing."}, {"id": "p2", "text": "After observing this hesitation, the ranger moved that sign closer to the turn."}, {"id": "p1", "text": "To test the signs, a ranger asked first-time visitors to follow the route without a map."}]'::jsonb, '["p3", "p1", "p4", "p2"]'::jsonb, 'ri-pte-expansion-5', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('pte-expansion-026', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'listening', 'pte-listening-mcma', 'MCQ Multiple Answer', 'Repair cafes', 'Listen and select all supported statements.', 150, 0, 0, 2, 'medium', ARRAY['PTE','Original practice','Expansion 2026'], 'Repair cafes teach owners maintenance skills through participation, while records of failed repairs can suggest design issues but cannot establish their prevalence because visitors bring a self-selected sample of products.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{"id": "A", "text": "Owners are expected to participate in the repair process."}, {"id": "B", "text": "Every object brought to a cafe is successfully repaired."}, {"id": "C", "text": "Repair records may help identify components for further investigation."}, {"id": "D", "text": "Cafe visitors form a random sample of product owners."}]'::jsonb, '["A", "C"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'A repair cafe brings volunteers and residents together to fix household objects. Its purpose is not simply to save the price of a replacement. By explaining each step, volunteers help owners understand why an object failed and how to maintain it. Some visitors arrive expecting a free repair service, however, and feel disappointed when they must participate. Organisers therefore describe the learning element clearly before accepting bookings. They also record items that cannot be repaired. These records can reveal recurring design problems, although they cannot establish how common a fault is across all products sold. A cafe sees only the objects that people choose to bring. Manufacturers could still use this limited evidence to identify components worth investigating. The strongest argument for a cafe is consequently educational rather than statistical: a successful visit can change the way someone thinks about ownership, even when the object itself remains broken.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
('pte-expansion-027', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'listening', 'pte-listening-mcsa', 'MCQ Single Answer', 'Repair cafes', 'What is the main point of the recording?', 150, 0, 0, 1, 'medium', ARRAY['PTE','Original practice','Expansion 2026'], 'Repair cafes teach owners maintenance skills through participation, while records of failed repairs can suggest design issues but cannot establish their prevalence because visitors bring a self-selected sample of products.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{"id": "A", "text": "Their educational value extends beyond whether each item is repaired."}, {"id": "B", "text": "They provide representative statistics on all household products."}, {"id": "C", "text": "Their main purpose is to replace professional repair businesses."}, {"id": "D", "text": "They require manufacturers to redesign every faulty component."}]'::jsonb, '["A"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'A repair cafe brings volunteers and residents together to fix household objects. Its purpose is not simply to save the price of a replacement. By explaining each step, volunteers help owners understand why an object failed and how to maintain it. Some visitors arrive expecting a free repair service, however, and feel disappointed when they must participate. Organisers therefore describe the learning element clearly before accepting bookings. They also record items that cannot be repaired. These records can reveal recurring design problems, although they cannot establish how common a fault is across all products sold. A cafe sees only the objects that people choose to bring. Manufacturers could still use this limited evidence to identify components worth investigating. The strongest argument for a cafe is consequently educational rather than statistical: a successful visit can change the way someone thinks about ownership, even when the object itself remains broken.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
