wn changes in method and location. Researchers could then decide which comparisons were defensible. A missing entry was left blank rather than treated as a day without rain. The project also retained images of the original pages so that uncertain handwriting could be checked. Its value lay not in producing a perfectly uniform series, but in making a varied historical record available with its limitations visible. Careful documentation allowed later users to ask questions that the original observers had never anticipated.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
('pte-expansion-062', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE'], 'listening', 'pte-highlight-incorrect-word', 'Highlight Incorrect Word', 'Community rainfall records', 'Listen and select words in the displayed transcript that differ from the recording.', 150, 0, 0, 3, 'medium', ARRAY['PTE','Original practice','Expansion 2026'], 'The recording uses digitised, defensible, limitations instead of the substituted words.', NULL, NULL, 'A local history group destroyed handwritten rainfall diaries kept by residents over many decades. The records offered information from places where official weather stations had never operated. However, the volunteers noticed that observers had used different containers and sometimes moved them between gardens. These changes could affect the amounts recorded. Rather than discarding the diaries, the group attached notes describing known changes in method and location. Researchers could then decide which comparisons were profitable. A missing entry was left blank rather than treated as a day without rain. The project also retained images of the original pages so that uncertain handwriting could be checked. Its value lay not in producing a perfectly uniform series, but in making a varied historical record available with its predictions visible. Careful documentation allowed later users to ask questions that the original observers had never anticipated.', NULL, '[{"id": "w1", "text": "A"}, {"id": "w2", "text": "local"}, {"id": "w3", "text": "history"}, {"id": "w4", "text": "group"}, {"id": "w5", "text": "destroyed"}, {"id": "w6", "text": "handwritten"}, {"id": "w7", "text": "rainfall"}, {"id": "w8", "text": "diaries"}, {"id": "w9", "text": "kept"}, {"id": "w10", "text": "by"}, {"id": "w11", "text": "residents"}, {"id": "w12", "text": "over"}, {"id": "w13", "text": "many"}, {"id": "w14", "text": "decades."}, {"id": "w15", "text": "The"}, {"id": "w16", "text": "records"}, {"id": "w17", "text": "offered"}, {"id": "w18", "text": "information"}, {"id": "w1